%% SC-08: 浏览和安装市场 Skills
%% 流程图: browse-marketplace.mermaid

flowchart TD
    Start([开始: 用户进入市场]) --> EnterMarket[进入市场页面<br/>/marketplace]
    EnterMarket --> CallAPI[调用 list_marketplace_skills API]
    CallAPI --> FetchFromDB[从数据库获取 Skills]
    FetchFromDB --> RenderList[渲染 Skill 卡片列表]

    RenderList --> UserAction{用户操作}
    UserAction -->|搜索| SearchSkills
    UserAction -->|筛选| FilterSkills
    UserAction -->|排序| SortSkills
    UserAction -->|安装| InstallSkill
    UserAction -->|查看详情| ViewDetails

    %% 搜索流程
    SearchSkills --> InputKeyword[输入搜索关键词]
    InputKeyword --> CallSearchAPI[调用 search_marketplace_skills API]
    CallSearchAPI --> QueryFTS5[查询 FTS5 全文索引]
    QueryFTS5 --> ReturnResults[返回搜索结果]
    ReturnResults --> UpdateList[更新列表]
    UpdateList --> UserAction

    %% 筛选流程
    FilterSkills --> ClickFilter[点击筛选按钮]
    ClickFilter --> SelectFilter{选择筛选类型}
    SelectFilter -->|来源| SelectSource[选择来源<br/>Featured/User]
    SelectFilter -->|类别| SelectCategory[选择类别]
    SelectFilter -->|安全等级| SelectSecurity[选择安全等级<br/>安全/风险/阻断]

    SelectSource --> ApplySourceFilter[应用来源筛选]
    SelectCategory --> ApplyCategoryFilter[应用类别筛选]
    SelectSecurity --> ApplySecurityFilter[应用安全筛选]

    ApplySourceFilter --> CallFilterAPI[调用 list_marketplace_skills_by_source API]
    ApplyCategoryFilter --> CallFilterAPI
    ApplySecurityFilter --> CallFilterAPI

    CallFilterAPI --> UpdateList
    UpdateList --> UserAction

    %% 排序流程
    SortSkills --> SelectSort{选择排序方式}
    SelectSort -->|评分| SortByScore[按质量评分排序]
    SelectSort -->|更新时间| SortByUpdated[按更新时间排序]
    SelectSort -->|安装量| SortByInstalls[按安装量排序]

    SortByScore --> UpdateList
    SortByUpdated --> UpdateList
    SortByInstalls --> UpdateList

    %% 安装流程
    InstallSkill --> ClickInstall[点击安装按钮]
    ClickInstall --> ImportFlow[参考 SC-01<br/>从 GitHub 导入流程]
    ImportFlow --> RefreshList[刷新列表]
    RefreshList --> UserAction

    %% 查看详情流程
    ViewDetails --> ClickSkill[点击 Skill 卡片]
    ClickSkill --> OpenSlideOver[打开 SlideOver 侧边抽屉]
    OpenSlideOver --> ShowDetailTabs[显示详情/配置/分享标签]
    ShowDetailTabs --> Close{关闭详情?}
    Close -->|是| UserAction
    Close -->|否| ShowDetailTabs

    style Start fill:#e1f5e1
